              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"Double speed = double KE\"",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " — Because of v², double speed means 4× KE."
